v1.0: SaaS launch — dashboard, auth, pricing, leaderboard, premium UI

Brand
- Linear-style indigo/violet identity (primary #5e5ce6) with aurora-glow backgrounds
- Geist Sans + Geist Mono via Tailwind v4 theme tokens
- Custom focus ring, scrollbar, selection, shimmer animation

UI primitives (Radix + shadcn-style patterns)
- Button (5 variants), Card, Badge, Input, Skeleton
- Tabs, Tooltip, DropdownMenu, Dialog
- Sonner toaster, cmdk Cmd+K command palette
- Motion-powered animated score gauge with gradient fill

App shell
- Collapsible sidebar (Overview/Sites/Compare/Leaderboard/Settings)
- Topbar with workspace, Cmd+K search trigger, notifications, avatar dropdown
- Auth-gated /dashboard layout with redirect-to-sign-in

Auth (dev-stub, swap to Clerk in production)
- Cookie-based session, email-only sign-in/sign-up flows
- /sign-in, /sign-up branded auth pages
- Sign-out via Server Action

Dashboard
- /dashboard overview with KPI cards, sites table, recent activity, empty state
- /dashboard/sites grid view with sparklines
- /dashboard/sites/[host] with score history, audit history table, issues tab
- /dashboard/compare side-by-side category diff
- /dashboard/settings with plan, billing portal stub, API access teaser

Pricing
- /pricing two-tier (Free 'Scan' / Pro 'Monitor' $29) with FAQ
- /pricing/checkout stubbed Stripe upgrade flow that flags account as Pro

Leaderboard
- /leaderboard public ranking sorted by score, dedup by host
- ItemList JSON-LD for AI citation

Marketing
- Rebuilt landing: aurora hero, animated URL input, recent audits preview, feature grid, rubric explainer, CTA, FAQ
- /changelog timeline with v0.1 to v1.0 build-in-public entries
- /docs complete 100-point methodology
- /about solo-founder bio
- /legal/privacy, /legal/terms placeholders

Report page (/r/[slug])
- Refactored with new brand, animated SVG gauge with gradient fill
- 'Claim this report' viral CTA for anonymous users
- Share, re-run, hire-CTA all integrated

Storage
- Added owner-id metadata to reports
- Audits attach ownerId automatically when authed

Self-audit: 95/100, Grade A, AI-optimized
